	Section:
		Text: Layers and rotation
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Rotate origin
		Paragraph: A rotated `Frame`, `Overlay` or `Page overlay` turns around its center by default. `Rotate origin` moves that point: one or two of `top`, `bottom`, `left`, `right` and `center`, or two measurements from the top left corner. Each cell turns the same box 30 degrees around the red dot. The dashed outline is the box unrotated.
